<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.9.1">
<l>maravaṭiyait tampikku vāṉpaṇayam</l>
<l rend="indent">vaittuppōy vāṉōr vāḻa</l>
<l>ceruvuṭaiya ticaikkaruman tiruttivantu</l>
<l rend="indent">ulakāṇṭa tirumāl kōyil</l>
<l>tiruvaṭitaṉ tiruvuruvun tirumaṅkai</l>
<l rend="indent">malarkaṇṇuṅ kāṭṭi niṉṟu</l>
<l>uruvuṭaiya malarnīlam kāṟṟāṭṭa</l>
<l rend="indent">ōcalikku moḷiya raṅkamē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The temple of Tirumāl who,</l>
<l rend="indent">having gone to give [his] wooden sandal</l>
<l>to [his] younger brother as a heavenly pledge,</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] having come to perfectly perform [his] duty</l>
<l>in the place of battle so that the celestials lived,</l>
<l rend="indent">rules the world,</l>
<l>is bright Araṅkam, where the wind shakes [and] moves</l>
<l rend="indent">the beautiful blue flowers, oho!,</l>
<l>revealing [his] divine feet and body,</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] the flower eye of [his] divine lady.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
